{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-common-biology-29","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"biology","number":29,"points":null,"unitId":"metabolism","unitLabel":"에너지 대사","topic":"ATP합성·광합성·광계","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["metabolism","plant"],"stem":"그림은고등식물의엽록체에서일어나는광합성의명반응에서\n전자흐름에의한ATP와NADPH 생성과정을나타낸것이다.\n위그림과관련된설명이나추론중옳은것을<보기>에서모두\n고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 광계II가받은빛에너지는스트로마쪽에서ATP 합성에\n이용된다.\nㄴ. NADPH는페레독신-NADP＋환원효소에의해생성된후\n스트로마에서이산화탄소고정에이용된다.\nㄷ. 전자흐름동안수소이온이ATP 합성효소를통해스트로\n마로방출되므로스트로마가틸라코이드내강보다더욱산성\n화된다.\nㄹ. 500 nm, 670 nm의두가지파장을동시에엽록체에조사\n하면, 500 nm 파장이광계안테나복합체의카로티노이드\n보다엽록소에서더많이흡수된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":745,"height":248,"region":0,"bbox":[20.355,48.385,298.0,99.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-29/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":492,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,207.585,308.8,196.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-29/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":8,"sourceRect":[429.645,624.415,758.256,1075.77],"width":328.611,"height":451.355,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[20.355,48.385,298.0,99.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[13.955,207.585,308.8,196.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"